<title>ITALY: BASKETBALL-FINAL FOUR RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-FINAL FOUR RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on Thursday at the men's</p>
<p>European clubs' basketball Final Four championship:</p>
<p>Third place playoff</p>
<p>Ljubljana (Slovenia) beat Villeurbanne (France) 86-79</p>
<p>(halftime 54-35)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Ljubljana - Marko Milic 17, I. Jurkovic 14, Arriel (correct)</p>
<p>McDonald 19</p>
<p>Villeurbanne - Alain Digbeu 22, Brian Howard 20</p>
<p>Add results:</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>Olympiakos 73 Barcelona 58 (halftime 31-29)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Olympiakos - David Rivers 26, Dragan Tarlac 11, Dimitry</p>
<p>Papaniikolau 11</p>
<p>Barcelona - Andres Jimenez 16, Arturas Karnisovas 14, Rafael</p>
<p>Jofresa 9.</p>
</text>
